ed value normalization keep provider-specific representations out of reconciliation logic."}, {"id": "plans_2026_07_31_phase_4_cloudflare_reconciler_v2_managed_key_ownership_allowlist", "label": "Managed-Key Ownership Allowlist", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-31-phase-4-cloudflare-reconciler-v2.md", "source_location": "## Global Constraints", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The reconciler may mutate only an explicit set disjoint from Terraform seeds and Azure auto-registered records."}, {"id": "plans_2026_07_31_phase_4_cloudflare_reconciler_v2_per_edge_convergence_runner", "label": "Per-Edge Convergence Runner", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-31-phase-4-cloudflare-reconciler-v2.md", "source_location": "### Task B3: runner.py \u2014 per-edge plan/apply with post-apply verification", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "plans_2026_07_31_phase_4_cloudflare_reconciler_v2_reconciler_0_2_1_exit_code_contract", "label": "Reconciler 0-2-1 Exit-Code Contract", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-31-phase-4-cloudflare-reconciler-v2.md", "source_location": "## Global Constraints", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Distinct codes for converged, drift, and operational error let CI report drift without misclassifying failures."}, {"id": "plans_2026_07_31_phase_4_cloudflare_reconciler_v2_committed_desired_state_snapshot_adr_006", "label": "Committed Desired-State Snapshot ADR-006", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-31-phase-4-cloudflare-reconciler-v2.md", "source_location": "## ADR-006: CI drift detection compares edges to a committed desired-state snapshot", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nightly CI